# COB reads docs/cob, the HTML guides, CHANGELOG.md and benchmarks/README.md at run time.
docs/*
!docs/cob
!docs/guide.html
!docs/deploy.html
!docs/benchmarks.html
# L5a release
!docs/requirements.html
!docs/getting-started.html
!docs/support.html
# /L5a release
tests
