*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# The dashboard builds in its own image; its packages and output never enter the engine's.
**/node_modules
services
# Only the result files the engine serves (GET /api/v1/models/fast-benchmarks, /answer-benchmarks, /benchmark-summary).
benchmarks/*
!benchmarks/README.md
!benchmarks/results
benchmarks/results/*
!benchmarks/results/fast-models.json
!benchmarks/results/summary.json
!benchmarks/results/answer-models.json
clients
